@host = http://localhost:5290

### 0. Start clean
POST {{host}}/api/reset

### 1. State: cash/equity 10,000, rates near seeds. Send twice, rates should move.
GET {{host}}/api/state
Accept: application/json

### 2. Marketable buy (limit just ABOVE current USD/EUR). Expect 201, Filled, long 1,000 @ 0.89
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pair": "UsdEur", "side": "Buy", "quantity": 1000, "limitPrice": 0.89 }

### 3. Far-off sell, stays Pending (id 1002)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pair": "UsdGbp", "side": "Sell", "quantity": 500, "limitPrice": 0.90 }

### 4a. Cancel it. Expect success, status Cancelled
DELETE {{host}}/api/orders/1002

### 4b. Cancel again. Expect 409
DELETE {{host}}/api/orders/1002

### 4c. Unknown order. Expect 404
DELETE {{host}}/api/orders/9999

### 5. Flip to short (limit just BELOW current USD/EUR). Expect cash ~9,988.64, short 500 @ 0.88
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pair": "UsdEur", "side": "Sell", "quantity": 1500, "limitPrice": 0.88 }

### 6. Over the exposure limit. Expect 400
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pair": "UsdChf", "side": "Buy", "quantity": 20000, "limitPrice": 0.80 }

### 7a. Validation: zero quantity. Expect 400
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pair": "UsdEur", "side": "Buy", "quantity": 0, "limitPrice": 0.88 }

### 7b. Validation: negative limit. Expect 400
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pair": "UsdEur", "side": "Buy", "quantity": 1000, "limitPrice": -1 }

### 7c. Validation: unknown pair. Expect 400
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pair": "UsdJpy", "side": "Buy", "quantity": 1000, "limitPrice": 0.88 }

### 8. Fills on a later tick: set limit ~0.0005 BELOW current USD/GBP, then re-send step 1 until Filled
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pair": "UsdGbp", "side": "Buy", "quantity": 1000, "limitPrice": 0.7545 }

### 9. Reset. Expect 10,000, nothing open, next id 1001
POST {{host}}/api/reset